  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I (Name of polymer)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II (Uses)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Glyptal</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Flexible pipes</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Neoprene</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Synthetic wool</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Acrilan</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Paints and Lacquers</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>LDP</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Gaskets</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :-</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
